{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2178122,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Helena Ganjalyan","original_name":"Helena Ganjalyan","popularity":0.3715,"profile_path":"/i7EEx51k1KZpFoufU5ElMXg4jCA.jpg","known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2LtjLdQwy4VPW8ajCFbgf90KOE6.jpg","id":1121956,"title":"Green Border","original_title":"Zielona granica","overview":"In the treacherous and swampy forests that make up the so called “green border” between Belarus and Poland, refugees from the Middle East and Africa trying to reach the European Union are trapped in a geopolitical crisis cynically engineered by Belarusian dictator Alexander Lukashenko. In an attempt to provoke Europe, refugees are lured to the border by propaganda promising easy passage to the EU. Pawns in this hidden war, the lives of Julia, a newly minted activist who has given up her comfortable life, Jan, a young border guard, and a Syrian family intertwine.","poster_path":"/oV5UYkwCq1ZnPhjc6y53LxhRcue.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":1.7329,"release_date":"2023-09-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.346,"vote_count":127},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/lmnO9x5MlPPlURzNq8Pe9fjVUVZ.jpg","id":573858,"title":"Dark, Almost Night","original_title":"Ciemno, prawie noc","overview":"A reporter, Alicja Tabor, after many years returns to her hometown of Wałbrzych to write a report about kidnapped children and also to face her own dark family history.","poster_path":"/ayNQIrEDAbubx4DgvqVcFdmSEiX.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[53,80,9648],"popularity":0.997,"release_date":"2019-03-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":3.941,"vote_count":34},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2zj3XMhUIoeP0PovvvpWnDwkLgk.jpg","id":1295479,"title":"Larp","original_title":"LARP. Miłość, trolle i inne questy","overview":"Sergiusz, a teenager at a technical school, is misunderstood by his family and bullied by hi